        "title": "Another Kathmandu must-see",
        "text": "You could spend days here but at least a few hours is a minimum if you want to see and experience the beauty, history and current goings-on at this temple complex. You should also be able to see a cremation in progress if you are there at the right times. \n\nThis is another Kathmandu must-see. For a bit extra, I'd recommend getting a guide to take you around and tell you the history and meaning of all of the things you will see while walking around this beautiful site.",
