        "title": "expensive entrance fee but worthy!",
        "text": "The entrance fee was 1000 rupees which's very expensive compared to living cost in Nepal, but the temple was interesting enough to pay for, especially the cremation which you could see before your eyes. Besides, you could see lots of people's believes and beautiful culture that's worth every rupees.\n\nTips: \n1. I took a mini van to this temple and it cost only 15 rupees. ^^ \n2. On the way from main street to the temple, there's a snack shop which its samosa and roti ring were very delicious!!! try it here, it's really cheap as well!",
